  "title": "11 to 15",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**১১–১৫** each have their own shape, so learn them by ear:\n\n**এগারো** 11 · **বারো** 12 · **তেরো** 13 · **চৌদ্দ** 14 · **পনেরো** 15\n\nSome echo the small numbers: **তেরো** sounds like **তিন** (3), **চৌদ্দ** starts like **চার** (4), and **পনেরো** like **পাঁচ** (5). Don't confuse **বারো** (12) with **বাবা** (father)!\n\nSums need no word for 'is': **দশ আর এক এগারো** 'ten and one is eleven'.\n\nNext lesson: 16 to 20.",
